ShrinklerDecompress.S from Shrinkler 4.7 by Aske Simon Christensen

Vendored rather than fetched at build time, so that the boot loader assembles offline and what ships is what
was reviewed. Only the data decompressor is kept: the file is cut where ShrinklerLoad and ShrinklerFree begin,
which need dos.library and would not fit in a boot block.

